# Optional. If unset, extract uses the deterministic mock already in the repo
# (PromptAwareExtractor). Schema-valid, verbatim-checked, no invented targets.
# Weekly extract of NEW/updated registry records needs a real key for quality.
#
# Add the same names as GitHub Actions repository secrets if you want the
# Monday cron to call a paid model. Either OpenAI or Anthropic is enough.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929

# Optional override. Default is the repo-relative data/ directory.
WH_DATA_DIR=

# Not required (no keys):
#   ClinicalTrials.gov v2  — ingest
#   Open Targets GraphQL   — enrich
#   Europe PMC             — enrich
#
# Wave-1b rights modules are stubs. Do not set these unless you are wiring a
# live client later. Unset keys raise NotConfigured or write empty_stub.
# Tests and CI must run with these empty (no network, no API spend).
# USPTO_ODP_API_KEY=
# EPO_OPS_KEY=
# EPO_OPS_SECRET=
# OPENCORPORATES_API_KEY=
# ORANGE_BOOK_LIVE=
